==English==

===Etymology===
Via {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|Aegaeum mare}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|Aἰγαῖον πέλαγος|}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|ĕjĕân}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[Aegean]] [[sea|Sea]]}}

# A sea in the northeastern part of the [[Mediterranean Sea|Mediterranean]].

